# ADHDPunt – environment variables
#
# The website currently needs NO environment variables: it has no backend,
# no database and no API keys. All content is static and prerendered at build time.
#
# If an external service is added later, copy this file to .env (never commit .env)
# and add the variable here with a placeholder value. Only variables prefixed with
# VITE_ are exposed to the browser – never put secrets in a VITE_ variable.
#
# Example (placeholder, not used yet):
# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://example.invalid/your-form-endpoint
